{"availability":"available","full":"imvictorma/market-pulse","name":"market-pulse","description":"Nasdaq-100 market temperature dashboard for long-term investors — auto-updated via GitHub Actions, hosted on GitHub Pages. 纳指100市场温度仪表盘：自动更新、微信推送。","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-07T16:10:02Z","updated":"2026-10-10T02:30:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://imvictorma.github.io/market-pulse/","topics":["automation","dashboard","data-visualization","finance","github-actions","github-pages","investing","nasdaq-100","python"],"demo":"https://imvictorma.github.io/market-pulse/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:22.084Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:22.084Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:22.084Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:22.084Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Market Pulse is a Nasdaq-100 market-temperature dashboard for long-term investors. After the US market close it automatically fetches quotes, computes a transparent five-factor temperature model, generates a mobile-first static page, and can push updates to WeChat via ServerChan.","It is not an up/down predictor. A higher temperature means higher \"contrarian allocation appeal\" across valuation, sentiment, trend, positioning, and the rate environment. The DCA multiplier shown on the page is model output, not investment advice."],"features":["Automatic quotes: Nasdaq-100, S&P 500, QQQ, VXN, US 10-year Treasury yield","Automatic indicators: 1/5/20-day changes, Wilder RSI(14), MA200 deviation, VXN percentile over the past 756 trading days","Manual indicators: Forward PE, TTM PE, CNN Fear & Greed, NAAIM, rate-environment score","Transparent five-factor scoring, temperature bands, reference DCA multiplier, and event alerts","data/history.csv upserts by data date — rerunning the same day creates no duplicates"],"sourceUrl":"https:/